WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.601 --> 00:00:03.534
-Guys, it's time to play the game that's sweeping the nation.

00:00:03.534 --> 00:00:05.267
It's...

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.834
[ Audience cheers ]

00:00:08.834 --> 00:00:12.133
-This is the game where we pick a random audience member

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:14.234
and guess if there's a 'stache under their mask.

00:00:14.234 --> 00:00:15.667
We've done it a few times on the show.

00:00:15.667 --> 00:00:17.400
It's sweeping the nation. -Sweeping the nation.

00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:19.701
-Yeah, so let's please welcome tonight's audience member,

00:00:19.701 --> 00:00:21.467
Ishon Parmar.

00:00:21.467 --> 00:00:23.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.167 --> 00:00:33.033
♪♪

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:35.234
Nice to see you. Welcome.

00:00:35.234 --> 00:00:37.100
Alright. This is very good.

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:39.634
Ishon, where are you from?

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.067
-Los Altos, California.

00:00:41.067 --> 00:00:42.734
-Hey. Los Altos, California.

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:44.501
Alright. That's all I can ask you.

00:00:44.501 --> 00:00:46.234
-Cool. -That's all I can ask you.

00:00:46.234 --> 00:00:47.634
Right now we have to figure out

00:00:47.634 --> 00:00:49.234
if you have a 'stache under that mask.

00:00:49.234 --> 00:00:50.834
Tariq, you're going to go first, bud.

00:00:50.834 --> 00:00:51.968
You can ask him one question,

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:54.267
but then you have to make your guess.

00:00:54.267 --> 00:01:00.567
-If -- If I took a piece of tape, masking tape,

00:01:00.567 --> 00:01:03.400
you know, electrical tape,

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:05.534
and taped it down on your upper lip,

00:01:05.534 --> 00:01:08.501
and then snatched it off really hard,

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.934
would it be painful,

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.734
very painful, or would it be not so painful?

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:15.267
-Not so painful.

00:01:15.267 --> 00:01:17.200
I'm pretty -- I've got a high pain tolerance.

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:19.100
-Ooh. -Hmm!

00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:20.167
-Yeah. -That's a zero.

00:01:20.167 --> 00:01:21.534
-Tariq, what's your guess?

00:01:21.534 --> 00:01:23.534
-I'm going to say no 'stache.

00:01:23.534 --> 00:01:25.534
-Gotcha. Alright, Higgins, your turn.

00:01:25.534 --> 00:01:27.567
Everyone's waiting. What is your question?

00:01:27.567 --> 00:01:28.767
-Everyone's waiting for me? -The world is.

00:01:28.767 --> 00:01:30.033
-Well, then I'll hurry up.

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:32.634
I won't take any time to ask this question.

00:01:32.634 --> 00:01:34.400
The question's going to come out now.

00:01:34.400 --> 00:01:35.968
I'm not wasting anybody's time.

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:38.033
I'm going to ask Ishon a question. This question is...

00:01:38.033 --> 00:01:39.767
-Something you thought of? -Yeah, I thought of this

00:01:39.767 --> 00:01:42.767
question to determine if you have a 'stache or not.

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:44.100
-And you're not gonna waste any time.

00:01:44.100 --> 00:01:45.701
-No, I don't want to waste time. People got stuff to do.

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:47.968
I don't want to waste these people's time.

00:01:47.968 --> 00:01:49.334
-Oh. Very good. We appreciate that. Thank you.

00:01:49.334 --> 00:01:51.701
-New York City! Come on! [ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:51.701 --> 00:01:54.701
-We appreciate it. We appreciate it.

00:01:54.701 --> 00:01:59.901
-If you were, say -- Not that you would.

00:01:59.901 --> 00:02:04.868
But if you were to write a paper on pornography, let's say...

00:02:04.868 --> 00:02:06.267
-Oh.

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:09.934
-...would you write it on the '70s brand or modern day?

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:13.734
-Hm. -That is my question to you.

00:02:13.734 --> 00:02:17.200
-I'm on the younger side, so I'd say the modern day.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:20.000
-Oh, okay.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.968
I got this. -Okay. What do you think?

00:02:21.968 --> 00:02:23.400
-I've got this.

00:02:23.400 --> 00:02:25.300
Because it's been zig-zagging away from the questions.

00:02:25.300 --> 00:02:27.567
Pain tolerance. Younger side.

00:02:27.567 --> 00:02:29.267
I'm going to say 'stache.

00:02:29.267 --> 00:02:30.534
-Wow. You're going the opposite way.

00:02:30.534 --> 00:02:32.033
-Yeah. -You're thinking 'stache.

00:02:32.033 --> 00:02:33.634
Alright. It's my turn. Here we go.

00:02:33.634 --> 00:02:35.167
-Are you going to ask him a question?

00:02:35.167 --> 00:02:36.300
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.567
When you eat chili... -Ooh.

00:02:39.567 --> 00:02:41.334
-...do you kind of smell it all day?

00:02:41.334 --> 00:02:43.834
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:45.467
-Uh, yes.

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:47.167
-Well, that could be because he has gas.

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.701
[ Laughter ]

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:51.067
Or a stomach issue. You know what I mean?

00:02:51.067 --> 00:02:52.701
He's trying to trick you.

00:02:52.701 --> 00:02:56.868
-Uh, that's interesting. I'm really close.

00:02:56.868 --> 00:02:58.901
But I will say he's got decent sideburns

00:02:58.901 --> 00:03:00.734
that I can see.

00:03:00.734 --> 00:03:04.133
So I'm going to say...

00:03:04.133 --> 00:03:05.701
I think he has a 'stache.

00:03:05.701 --> 00:03:07.501
-We got two 'stache. -And one no stache.

00:03:07.501 --> 00:03:09.467
Alright. Here we go. It's time to find out...

00:03:09.467 --> 00:03:13.000
-Audience: Is there a 'stache under that mask?!

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:14.601
[ Drum roll ]

00:03:14.601 --> 00:03:16.167
-Oh! Yeah!

00:03:16.167 --> 00:03:17.934
♪♪

00:03:17.934 --> 00:03:19.267
-Look at that. That's what I'm talking about.

00:03:19.267 --> 00:03:22.367
I love that! He does have a 'stache!

00:03:22.367 --> 00:03:26.133
For playing, you won a year's supply of Turtle Wax.

00:03:26.133 --> 00:03:29.067
Turtle Wax. When you're here, you're family.

00:03:29.067 --> 00:03:31.367
This has been "Is There a 'Stache Under That Mask?"

